# SCENE · the purse a journey shops with: 39,950 on top of the 50 a new game starts with
# (app::STARTING_CASH), so every journey plays with the 40,000 it was written against.
# A player earns cash by fishing, which no journey can do on cue, so the stake is handed over in
# debug mode, which is switched straight back off, like the Computer in grow-a-matrixtank.play.

run !debugmode
run /add cash 39950
run !debugmode
